// Наряд №329 (issue #423) — dogfooding: the Fosved Office message contour
// under the Wave-1 gate (№325 sink clearance + №327 integrity), with the
// minimal annotation set. The ergonomics measurement (share of annotated
// lines vs the 50% Go threshold) is pinned in tests/naryad_329_dogfood.rs.
//
// The contour: the office assistant drafts the morning brief with
// call_llm (a Source: public conf, UNTRUSTED integrity — №316), delivers
// it to the owner chat via send_message (an irreversible Sink), and posts
// a metrics webhook. The gate demands exactly TWO annotations:
//   1. escape_html(draft)       — the LLM draft is untrusted; network and
//                                 output sinks refuse untrusted data
//                                 (UNTRUSTED_EGRESS_NETWORK family).
//   2. redact(token, hash_only) — the webhook token is a Secret source;
//                                 the one-way hash is the ONLY downward
//                                 move (№326); without it the raw token
//                                 into http_post is SECRET_EGRESS_NETWORK.
// Everything else is inferred (ADR-0154 Appendix A) — zero label
// annotations on variables, parameters, or signatures.
//
// Determinism: call_llm runs in mock mode by default; the webhook branch
// is live in production but dead in CI (the constant guard) so tests never
// touch the network; without TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN send_message takes the
// audit-stub path (an [AUDIT] line on stderr). The static gate sees both
// branches identically — dead code is still gated code.

pattern Dispatch(task: String) -> String {
  let draft = call_llm(task)
  let safe = escape_html(draft)
  let _ = send_message("fosved-owner-chat", safe)
  if 2.0 == 1.0 then {
    let stamp = redact(env("FOSVED_WEBHOOK_TOKEN"), "hash_only")
    let _ = http_post("https://hooks.fosved.example/metrics", safe + "|" + stamp)
  } else {
    let _ = print("[dry-run] webhook body: " + safe)
  }
  return "dispatched"
}
flow Main { input: String = "Собери статус по фазе 1 и отправь сводку" -> Dispatch -> output }
